        "type": "text-editor",
        "html": "\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"color: #5e5e5e; font-family: &#x27;Pt Serif&#x27;, serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><strong style=\"text-align: var(--text-align);\"><em>Local knowledge is great, but highly curated local knowledge is so much greater.</em></strong></p><p style=\"color: #5e5e5e; font-family: &#x27;Pt Serif&#x27;, serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 20px;\">Each of my downloadable e-guides will save you hours of research with:</p><p style=\"color: #5e5e5e; font-family: &#x27;Pt Serif&#x27;, serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2022 Hand-picked hotels</p><p style=\"color: #5e5e5e; font-family: &#x27;Pt Serif&#x27;, serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2022 Top-rated activities</p><p style=\"color: #5e5e5e; font-family: &#x27;Pt Serif&#x27;, serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2022 Local restaurants and bars</p><p style=\"color: #5e5e5e; font-family: &#x27;Pt Serif&#x27;, serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2022 Hidden gems only locals know about</p><p style=\"color: #5e5e5e; font-family: &#x27;Pt Serif&#x27;, serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022 All with clickable links so you can book with ease</span></p><p style=\"color: #5e5e5e; font-family: &#x27;Pt Serif&#x27;, serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Only $5 each, </span>entirely curated by I am Lost and Found, and delivered to your inbox in seconds.</p><p><strong>Click below to get yours!</strong></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t",
