  "travel-coaching-2": {
    "title": "Travel Coaching",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "html": "\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">TRAVEL COACHING</h3>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t",
        "index": 0
      },
      {
        "type": "image",
        "html": "\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"596\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/iamlostandfound.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/JamieEgypt3.jpg?fit=400%2C596&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-24948\" alt=\"Jamie in Egypt\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/iamlostandfound.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/JamieEgypt3.jpg?w=400&amp;ssl=1 400w, https://i0.wp.com/iamlostandfound.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/JamieEgypt3.jpg?resize=201%2C300&amp;ssl=1 201w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t",
        "index": 1
      },
      {
        "type": "text-editor",
        "html": "\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>I love talking about travel. Put me in a coffee shop and within minutes I\u2019ll be comparing favorite trips, restaurants, and hotels with the person sitting next to me.</p><p>If you\u2019re here, you likely share my style of wanderlust. But even the most enthusiastic travelers find that researching is a commitment they don\u2019t have the time or energy for. These days, it\u2019s not a lack of information. It\u2019s too much of it. Too many choices, too many keywords, too many hours lost down rabbit holes.</p><p>That\u2019s where I come in. Research is my sweet spot.</p><p>Anyone can Google a destination, but knowing the right sources, finding the lesser-known gems, and the places worth your time\u2014well, that\u2019s an art that takes time. I cut through the noise, saving you from <strong>hours of searching in the wrong places.\u00a0</strong></p><p>Jamie Edwards Travel Coaching is a curated, considered approach to help you plan your next adventure, designed with your specific needs, budget, and travel style in mind. <strong>I research every trip as if I were taking it myself.</strong> My recommendations are shaped by intention; what\u2019s worth your time and what\u2019s not.</p><p>After visiting more than <strong>70 countries across all seven continents,</strong> I know how overwhelming travel planning can be. But I also know it doesn\u2019t have to feel that way.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t",
        "index": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "html": "\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">HOW IT WORKS</h3>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t",
        "index": 3
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "html": "\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Complimentary Discovery Call</h4>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t",
        "index": 4
      },
      {
        "type": "text-editor",
        "html": "\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>You talk, I listen. We\u2019ll uncover your travel style\u2014your must-haves, deal-breakers, budget, travel dreams (and travel nightmares).</p><p>Click here to schedule your <a href=\"https://calendly.com/jamie-iamlostandfound/45min\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>Complimentary Discovery Call</b></a></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t",
        "index": 5
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "html": "\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Deliverables</h3>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t",
        "index": 6
      },
      {
        "type": "text-editor",
        "html": "\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Should you choose to work with me, you\u2019ll receive highly curated destination ideas, complete with lodging, must-do experiences, and hidden gems\u2014all with <strong>clickable</strong>\u00a0links so you can easily book.</p>\n<p>Access to my<strong> library of hundreds of destinations\u00a0</strong>based on 25+ years of travel, including places you didn\u2019t even know existed.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t",
        "index": 7
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "html": "\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Follow-Up</h3>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t",
        "index": 8
      },
      {
        "type": "divider",
        "html": "\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t",
        "index": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "text-editor",
        "html": "\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>We\u2019ll refine, tweak, and finalize. By the end, you\u2019ll have your next adventure\u00a0<em>ready to book</em>.</p><p><strong>Jamie Edwards Travel Coaching. My research. Your adventure.</strong></p><p>Click here to schedule your <a href=\"https://calendly.com/jamie-iamlostandfound/45min\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>Complimentary Discovery Call </b></a>on my calendar. No pressure\u2014just travel talk.</p><p>I\u2019m ready when you are.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t",
        "index": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "html": "\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">PERSONALIZED COACHING SERVICES START AT $600</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t",
        "index": 11
      },
      {
        "type": "divider",
        "html": "\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t",
        "index": 12
      },
      {
        "type": "image",
        "html": "\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"768\" height=\"593\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/iamlostandfound.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/1.png?fit=768%2C593&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"attachment-medium_large size-medium_large wp-image-18977\" alt=\"Travel Coaching Logo\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/iamlostandfound.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/1.png?w=2000&amp;ssl=1 2000w, https://i0.wp.com/iamlostandfound.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/1.png?resize=300%2C232&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/iamlostandfound.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/1.png?resize=1024%2C791&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/iamlostandfound.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/1.png?resize=768%2C593&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/iamlostandfound.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/1.png?resize=1536%2C1187&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/iamlostandfound.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/1.png?resize=600%2C464&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/iamlostandfound.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/1.png?w=1600 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t",
        "index": 13
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "html": "\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">My Research. Your Adventure.</h3>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t",
        "index": 14
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "html": "\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Please fill out the form below and let's get started.</h3>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t",
        "index": 15
      },
      {
        "type": "inquiry",
        "html": "",
        "index": 16
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "html": "\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">CLIENT TESTIMONIALS</h3>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t",
        "index": 17
      },
      {
        "type": "divider",
        "html": "\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t",
        "index": 18
      },
      {
        "type": "text-editor",
        "html": "\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\u201cFinding the right place to fit your family, budget, and interests can be daunting and overwhelming. I\u2019ve always loved seeing Jamie\u2019s social media posts and love how\u00a0<strong>she finds places before the masses do,</strong>\u00a0and they always have a mix of luxury, relaxation, adventure, and beauty. I knew she was the perfect person to help plan our summer family trip.\u00a0<strong>Her guidance was spot on.</strong>\u00a0Thank you, Jamie!\u201d</p>\n<p><em>-Susan S. (on planning Hawaii)</em></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t",
        "index": 19
      },
      {
        "type": "divider",
        "html": "\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t",
        "index": 20
      },
      {
        "type": "text-editor",
        "html": "\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\u201cI can\u2019t recommend Jamie enough as a travel coach! With two young kids, we wanted to take a trip but\u00a0<strong>felt completely overwhelmed by the research. </strong>Then we found Jamie.</p>\n<p>She guided us through a discovery process to pinpoint what truly mattered to us and <strong>curated personalized recommendations, complete with links to accommodations,</strong> and the pros and cons of each choice. But her firsthand experience set her apart<strong>\u2014</strong> insights you won\u2019t find online. Like how attentive the staff would be to kids, whether the resort\u2019s \u201call-inclusive\u201d actually covered what we\u2019d need and even hidden costs that aren\u2019t obvious at first glance.</p>\n<p>Her expertise made the difference between another year of saying \u201cmaybe next time\u201d and <strong>booking the perfect trip.</strong> If you\u2019re feeling stuck in the planning stage, Jamie is exactly who you need!\u201d</p>\n<p><em>-Jay T. (on planning a family Caribbean getaway)</em></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t",
        "index": 21
      },
      {
        "type": "divider",
        "html": "\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t",
        "index": 22
      },
      {
        "type": "text-editor",
        "html": "\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\u201cCurrently basking on the beach, thinking\u2026 how did we get here? Didn&#8217;t know how badly we needed this vacation until our feet hit the sand. THANK YOU for the <strong>guidance and inspiration,</strong> Jamie!\u201d</p>\n<p><em>-Claire G.</em></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t",
        "index": 23
      },
      {
        "type": "divider",
        "html": "\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t",
        "index": 24
      }
    ]
